      INDIA REAL ESTATE BENCHMARK • SAVE UP TO ₹8.4 LAKHS ANNUALLY VS AGENCY RETAINERS
    </div>

    <!-- Header Navigation -->
    <header class="header-nav">
      <div class="container header-container">
